<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Komercni to announce 96 results Thur.</title>
<headline>Czech Komercni to announce 96 results Thur.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Komercni Banka a.s., the largest Czech commercial bank, said on Monday it would hold a news conference on its final 1996 results on Thursday at 9 a.m. (0800 GMT).</p>
<p>The bank posted a 5.24 billion crown preliminary net profit, according to international accounting standards, after a 5.11 billion net profit in 1996.</p>
<p>Its preliminary net profit under Czech accounting standards was 5.36 billion, after 5.16 billion crowns in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
